{"path":"utility/bitset/operator_logic","title":"std::bitset<N>::operator&=,|=,^=,~","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::bitset&lt;N&gt;::</span>operator&amp;=,|=,^=,~","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/bitset/operator_logic","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Performs binary AND, OR, XOR and NOT.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td><div><span id=\"Version_1\"></span><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">bitset<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> bitset<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(noexcept since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(constexpr since C++23)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td><div><span id=\"Version_2\"></span><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">bitset<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy3\">|</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> bitset<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(noexcept since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(constexpr since C++23)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td><div><span id=\"Version_3\"></span><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">bitset<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy3\">^</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> bitset<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(noexcept since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(constexpr since C++23)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td><div><span id=\"Version_4\"></span><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">bitset operator~<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(noexcept since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(constexpr since C++23)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Performs binary AND, OR, XOR and NOT.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Sets the bits to the result of binary AND on corresponding pairs of bits of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Sets the bits to the result of binary OR on corresponding pairs of bits of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Sets the bits to the result of binary XOR on corresponding pairs of bits of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> Returns a temporary copy of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> with all bits flipped (binary NOT).</div>\n<p>Note that <code>&amp;=</code>, <code>|=</code>, and <code>^=</code> are only defined for bitsets of the same size <code>N</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another bitset\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1-3)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">flip</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code></div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;bitset&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstddef&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> pattern_str<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"1001\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">16</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> pattern<span class=\"br0\">{</span>pattern_str<span class=\"br0\">}</span>, dest<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> i <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> dest.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> pattern_str.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> i <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">--</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        dest <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;=</span> pattern_str.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        dest <span class=\"sy3\">|</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> pattern<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> dest <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" (i = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\")<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> ~dest <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" (~dest)<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>0000000000001001 (i = 4)\n0000000010011001 (i = 3)\n0000100110011001 (i = 2)\n1001100110011001 (i = 1)\n0110011001100110 (~dest)</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset/operator_ltltgtgt\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator&lt;&lt;=</span><span>operator&gt;&gt;=</span><span>operator&lt;&lt;</span><span>operator&gt;&gt;</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  performs binary shift left and shift right <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/bitset","title":"std::bitset"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::bitset<N>::operator&=,|=,^=,~","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations. Performs binary AND, OR, XOR and NOT."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator<<=, operator>>=, operator<<, …","note":"performs binary shift left and shift right"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++23"],"wordCount":241,"codeBlockCount":2}
